00:57:15.610 --> 00:57:20.100
<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to a program's co-founder, Torey Malatia, or as we like to call him--

00:57:20.100 --> 00:57:25.840
<v Dana Chivvis>--the grape smuggler, the Miami meat tent, the dingaling sling, Saint-Tropez truffle duffle.

00:57:25.840 --> 00:57:30.840
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life
